{{#*inline "title"}}Mission Control | Twennie{{/inline}}

<section class="teach-me-page">

  <div class="pareto-visual">
    <img src="/images/spybluey.png" alt="Mission Control">
  </div>

  <h1 class="teach-me-main-heading">Mission Control</h1>

  <div class="teach-me-orientation">
    <div class="orientation-block">
      <h2 class="orientation-heading">turn learning into action</h2>

      <p class="orientation-intro">
        Mission Control is Twennie’s collaborative workspace for Missions — structured initiatives that help teams explore ideas, test improvements, and move learning into action.
      </p>

      <ul class="orientation-list">
        <li>Missions are designed for teams working together.</li>
        <li>They help leaders guide research, learning, and internal improvement.</li>
        <li>They create momentum and accountability across a group.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>


  <div class="teach-me-feature-strip">

    <div class="teach-me-feature-card">
      <img src="/images/spybluey.png" alt="Mission Control mascot" class="teach-me-feature-image">

      <button class="teach-me-toggle is-open" type="button">
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-label">why you need to upgrade</span>
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-arrow"></span>
      </button>

      <div class="teach-me-feature-body">
        <ul class="teach-me-feature-list">
          <li>Mission Control is designed for teams collaborating inside a firm.</li>
          <li>Individual memberships focus on personal learning and reflection.</li>
          <li>Missions require group coordination and leadership oversight.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div class="teach-me-feature-card">
      <img src="/images/blueygroup.png" alt="Group membership" class="teach-me-feature-image">

      <button class="teach-me-toggle is-open" type="button">
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-label">what group membership unlocks</span>
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-arrow"></span>
      </button>

      <div class="teach-me-feature-body">
        <ul class="teach-me-feature-list">
          <li>Participate in team missions</li>
          <li>Work with colleagues on learning initiatives</li>
          <li>Receive mission assignments from your leader</li>
          <li>Contribute to collaborative research and development</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div class="teach-me-feature-card">
      <img src="/images/leaderbluey_2.png" alt="Leader membership" class="teach-me-feature-image">

      <button class="teach-me-toggle is-open" type="button">
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-label">why leaders use mission control</span>
        <span class="teach-me-toggle-arrow"></span>
      </button>

      <div class="teach-me-feature-body">
        <ul class="teach-me-feature-list">
          <li>Create missions for team learning and exploration</li>
          <li>Assign initiatives to group members</li>
          <li>Track participation and progress</li>
          <li>Turn knowledge into practical action across the organization</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="teach-me-container">

    <div class="teach-me-columns">

      <div class="teach-me-column">
        <h2 class="column-heading">individual membership</h2>

        <p class="teach-me-column-intro">
          Individual memberships are designed for personal learning and professional development.
        </p>

        <ul class="teach-me-column-list">
          <li>Access Twennie learning units</li>
          <li>Complete prompt sets</li>
          <li>Record personal learning notes</li>
          <li>Review your individual progress</li>
        </ul>
      </div>


      <div class="teach-me-column">
        <h2 class="column-heading">group membership</h2>

        <p class="teach-me-column-intro">
          Group memberships add collaborative learning and shared development.
        </p>

        <ul class="teach-me-column-list">
          <li>Participate in missions</li>
          <li>Work through assignments together</li>
          <li>Collaborate on team initiatives</li>
          <li>Contribute to shared learning</li>
        </ul>
      </div>


      <div class="teach-me-column">
        <h2 class="column-heading">leader membership</h2>

        <p class="teach-me-column-intro">
          Leader memberships provide tools to guide development across a team.
        </p>

        <ul class="teach-me-column-list">
          <li>Create and assign missions</li>
          <li>Guide learning initiatives</li>
          <li>Track participation</li>
          <li>Turn learning into action</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>


  <div class="promptset-cta-buttons">
    <h2 class="section-title">ready to launch missions?</h2>

    <div class="cta-button-group">
      <a href="/group_memberships" class="cta-button">explore group memberships</a>
      <a href="/dashboard/member" class="cta-button">return to dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>